lisa-addressed:
- X:correctness/node-release-tag-has-component (fp e6ff18daf83e): set "include-component-in-tag": false on the "." package so release-please tags vX.Y.Z, matching release-ui.yml's tag-prefix v.

lisa-design:
- packages."." sets include-component-in-tag: false (beyond the spec's {"release-type":"node"}) because the node strategy otherwise tags mock-ui-vX.Y.Z, which release-ui.yml/cut-prerelease.yml (tag-prefix v) reject. Chosen over passing tag-prefix mock-ui-v to keep the org-wide vX.Y.Z tag convention.
